{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんにちは！\n新内眞衣です！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/29/3817663/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ空いてしまって\nすみません(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国ツアー地方公演が\n終わってしまいました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨年のツアーは地方公演に参加\n出来なかったので、\n本当に楽しかったです(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行く場所によって\n声援などが違ったり、\n土地ごとの美味しいものを\n食べられたり\n地方公演の醍醐味を味わえました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに各地方限定の\nTシャツも販売されてたよ(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/29/3817663/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(名古屋Tシャツは時間がなくて\n取れなかったので、れな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/29/3817663/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":")"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれも可愛いよね！\nもちろん神宮限定のも可愛いから\n是非チェックしてみて下さい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/29/3817663/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、みんな言ってるけど、\n今回の推しタオルの\n見つけやすさたるやo(｀ω´ )o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"団扇も見えるけど、\n推しタオルは2階席でも\nばっちり見える←←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん手作り団扇や\nサイリウムも見えてるよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとう(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブは生ものだから\n上手くいかなかったり、\n予定とは違うことがあったりしたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎公演、本当に思い出が\nたくさん出来たし、\nいろんな事を勉強になりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラストは明後日の神宮！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう明後日とか\n実感ないよーーー(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしてて下さいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/29/3817663/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------------------------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/29/3817663/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週公開されたやつでは\n奥多摩へキャンプに\n行ってきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツアーがあるから\n夏らしい事は出来ないかなー？\nって思ってたんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんな事やこんな事をして\n夏を満喫出来ました(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネタバレになるからあんまり\n書かないけど、\n女子力や大人らしさを\n少し見せられたかな、、？？←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、\nキャンプファッションは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日焼けと虫刺され対策に\nハットとカーディガン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"動きやすいように\nパンツスタイルとペタンコ靴"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも女性らしさを出すために\n腕を上げるとお腹や背中が\nちよっくらチラリズム\nしてるんです(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完全防備より、\nこっちのがいいよと\n先輩OLに教えて貰いました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほらさ！\nキャンプとか普段行かないからさ！\nこういうのは世間を知ってる\nOLの先輩に聞いた方が\nいいかなと思ってさ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏らしさ全開で\n盛りだくさんな内容に\nなってますので、\n是非チェックして下さい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/29/3817663/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週もキャンプの後編です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみに(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てなわけで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8月誕生日特集"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/29/3817663/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/29/3817663/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真洋さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/29/3817663/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/29/3817663/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなさん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/29/3817663/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/29/3817663/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/29/3817663/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/29/3817663/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白石さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/29/3817663/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/29/3817663/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/29/3817663/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りんごさん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/29/3817663/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/29/3817663/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"琴子"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/29/3817663/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/29/3817663/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/29/3817663/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3周年を迎えた乃木坂46を\nこれからもよろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グループとしても\n個人としても\nもっと輝けるように頑張らなきゃ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこの辺で(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また書きます！"}],"source":"archive"}